            "review_text": "Dreamer25999247280\n4 contributions\n1\nDelicious food, clean space, polite, very attentive service\nSep 2026 • Couples\nCelebrating our wedding anniversary, I accidentally went to this restaurant and discovered the food here is really delicious. Here, we specialize in Vietnamese specialties. Only when I asked did I know the restaurant had been operating for over 15 years; the restaurant was opened to let customers experience specialty dishes. Before, the distribution of processed products was not widespread domestically and internationally. If you have a chance, please stop by and try it because the food, atmosphere, and service here are very delicious and absolutely wonderful 😊.\nRead more\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten September 28, 2026",
